                                                                                                \n\n\n\n**RAISE DINO**\n\n{802769962423593}\n\nDINO SMALL. AWW. GIVE GOOD NAME. STRONG NAME. LIKE MUG. RHYME WITH UG. \n\n**RIDE DINO**\n\n{1683283132386209}\n\nFEED DINO. NOW BIG. RIDE DINO. GO ADVENTURE. NO GO IN CAVE. TOO SCARY. STAY BY WATER WITH FRIEND. SAFE. \n\n\n**COLLECT DINO**\n\n{1100334291498447}\n\nWANT OTHER DINO? TRADE WITH FRIEND. FRIEND HAPPY. \n\n**LOOK PRETTY**\n\nLOINCLOTH SO LAST SUMMER. GET NEW. ALL OTHER UG JEALOUS. \n\n**MORE DINO**\n\nUG UPDATE THURSDAY. NEW DINO. MAYBE NEW MAP. NEW BUG? UG FIX BUG. UG PROUD.\n\nJOIN TRIBE\u2026 DISCORD.GG/UGVR", "short_description": "HATCH, RAISE, RIDE DINOSAUR. HELP FRIEND TRADE, FIGHT BOSS. FRIEND DIE. NO LAUGH. NOT FUNNY... OKAY MAYBE SMALL LAUGH. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Continuum VR Studios", "support_website_url": "http://discord.gg/ugvr", "website_url": "https://www.ug-vr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "27904187899273710"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"